+and `ADJUDICATED` styling generated by `tools/assets/generate-starter-art.ts`
+and listed in `src/assets/starter-art-manifest.ts` are project-original art
+released with this repository under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
+International License. The generated SVG files under `public/assets/art/` and
+the visual review artifact under `docs/design/assets-preview/` are covered by
+this grant. The generator software and TypeScript inputs remain MIT-licensed.
+
+The required notice, reproduced exactly from
+`docs/licenses/STARTER-ART-NOTICE.txt`, is:
+
+> “Starter Pixel Art and Ink Room” by SRD-55 contributors. Source: the accompanying checked-in generator and fixed inputs in src/assets/. Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode). Generated outputs are unmodified renderings of those fixed inputs.
+
+No external art, icon, tile, texture, font, or generated-art service is used
+to produce this collection.
+
+### Homebrew and design documents
+
 `docs/homebrew/README.md` releases this project's own homebrew documents —
 the `docs/homebrew/cc-by/` tree, the design-guidelines corpus, and the
 surrounding project-original documents — under the Creative Commons
