+You are the independent assumptions reviewer for VTT increment 8 in /home/vagrant/PhpstormProjects/dnd-lane-vtt3a. Read-only: do not edit anything. This is an assumptions pass, not implementation review.
+
+Binding request: build checked-in deterministic PURE PROCEDURAL pixel-art silhouettes under CC-BY-4.0 self-attribution. No external asset families or network fetches. Inventory is the 9 existing exports in src/combat/statblocks/monsters.ts plus Fighter, Cleric, Wizard, Rogue. Include one-room map tiles, terrain, fog styling, active-PC focus, ADJUDICATED styling, fixed checked-in inputs, stable asset ids, manifest with generator version/inputs/license, board renderer and an encounter-package schema consuming ids. Mutations: 51 missing license row, 52 dist attribution omitted, 53 filename-based identity, 54 remote runtime texture. Determinism must compare byte-identical sprite output and pin hashes in an independent expectation table. Commit an SVG/PNG board preview under docs/design/assets-preview. No database changes. Allowed tests only tests/unit/combat, tests/unit/vtt, new tests/unit/assets, schema-inventory only if DB touched, tools/sim unchanged-green, both tsc configs. No git operations.
+
+Project default binds IMPLEMENTER=CODEX and REVIEWER=CLAUDE Sonnet. Existing tree has unrelated untracked .tmp-*.log files that must remain untouched. The current encounter uses 3 PCs plus one training brute; the fourth class art is inventory-only.
+
+Independently enumerate assumptions and contradictions that must be proved before this plan is safe. Inspect the relevant source, package scripts, license/dist path, current board renderer/projections, public asset/build conventions, and tests. For each assumption mark PROVED, DISPROVED, or UNPROVED, cite file:line, and say what claim depends on it. Flag any required plan correction. Be concise but substantive.
